  "description": "MoleculeView — a .NET MAUI control for interactive 2D chemical structures. Bind SMILES (depicted by any registered IChemistryEngine) or a precomputed depiction, colour atoms by heat-map weights, select and hover atoms with MVVM bindings and commands, follow light/dark themes, and export the rendered structure. Contains no chemistry toolkit: add MolDraw.Core for the NCDK engine or write your own.",
